```

This means the entire **selected drive**, not necessarily every drive in the machine. Ubuntu’s installer supports selecting one drive when a computer has multiple drives.

Select only the approximately 2 TB HDD.

Verify:

* Manufacturer
* Model
* Size
* Serial number when shown

Do not select:

