```

## 9.7 Review the final summary

Before clicking Install, verify the summary shows:

* The approximately 2 TB HDD
* Entire-disk installation
* Encryption enabled
* No formatting of the approximately 1 TB SSD
* Correct keyboard and timezone

This is the final destructive checkpoint.

Only proceed when every item is correct.

## 9.8 Complete the installation

Allow the installer to finish.

When prompted:

1. Restart.
2. Remove the Ubuntu USB.
3. Press Enter.

At the next boot, enter the disk-encryption passphrase.

Then enter the Ubuntu account password.

