nvidia-smi
```

Expected result:

* NVIDIA driver information
* RTX 2070 SUPER
* Approximately 8 GB VRAM
* No “driver not loaded” error

Ollama’s official Linux instructions also use `nvidia-smi` to verify NVIDIA support.

Do not continue to local model installation until `nvidia-smi` works.

