sudo chmod 0640 /etc/local-ai/open-webui.env
```

Verify permissions without printing the contents:

```bash
sudo ls -l /etc/local-ai/open-webui.env
```

Expected ownership resembles:

```text
root aiweb
```

Expected permissions resemble:

```text
-rw-r-----
```

Clear the secrets from the interactive shell:

```bash
