## 15.7 Create the hardened systemd service

Run:

```bash
sudo tee /etc/systemd/system/open-webui.service >/dev/null <<'EOF'
[Unit]
Description=Restricted Local Open WebUI
After=network-online.target postgresql.service ollama.service
Wants=network-online.target
Requires=postgresql.service ollama.service

[Service]
Type=simple
User=aiweb
Group=aiweb
SupplementaryGroups=ai-readers ai-writers

EnvironmentFile=/etc/local-ai/open-webui.env
WorkingDirectory=/srv/local-ai/open-webui

ExecStart=/opt/open-webui/venv/bin/open-webui serve --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8080

Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5
TimeoutStopSec=30
UMask=0077

NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true
PrivateDevices=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
ProtectKernelTunables=true
ProtectKernelModules=true
ProtectKernelLogs=true
ProtectControlGroups=true
ProtectClock=true
RestrictSUIDSGID=true
LockPersonality=true
CapabilityBoundingSet=
AmbientCapabilities=
SystemCallArchitectures=native
RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_UNIX AF_INET AF_INET6

ReadOnlyPaths=/srv/local-ai/vault
ReadOnlyPaths=/srv/local-ai/imports

ReadWritePaths=/srv/local-ai/open-webui
ReadWritePaths=/srv/local-ai/proposed
ReadWritePaths=/srv/local-ai/reports
ReadWritePaths=/srv/local-ai/audit
ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/aiweb

IPAddressDeny=any
IPAddressAllow=localhost

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
EOF
```

Before starting, verify that the installed Open WebUI version recognizes the flags:

```bash
sudo -u aiweb -H /opt/open-webui/venv/bin/open-webui serve --help
```

Confirm that `--host` and `--port` appear.

## 15.8 Start Open WebUI

Run:

```bash
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable --now open-webui
```

Check:

```bash
sudo systemctl status open-webui
```

Inspect logs:

```bash
sudo journalctl -u open-webui -n 100 --no-pager
```

Test the local page:

```bash
curl -I http://127.0.0.1:8080
```

Verify the listening address:

```bash
sudo ss -ltnp | grep 8080
```

Expected:

```text
