```ini
IPAddressDeny=any
IPAddressAllow=localhost
```

Do not remove the other hardening settings, and do not bind Open WebUI publicly.

## 15.9 Create the first administrator account

Open Firefox in Ubuntu.

Visit:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8080
```

