```

## 15.11 Confirm disabled capabilities in the interface

In the Open WebUI administration area, confirm:

* Web Search is disabled.
* No web-search provider is configured.
* Code Interpreter is disabled.
* Knowledge Base execution is disabled.
* No Open Terminal is configured.
* No Open WebUI Computer connection exists.
* No MCP servers are configured.
* No OpenAPI tool servers are configured.
* No community functions are installed.
