## Before updating Open WebUI

1. Run the database backup.
2. Make an external Restic backup.
3. Record the current version.
4. Update inside the virtual environment.
5. Restart the service.
6. Test login, chats, models, and retrieval.
7. Restore from backup if the update causes data or migration problems.

Update command:

```bash
sudo -u aiweb -H /usr/local/bin/uv pip install \
    --upgrade \
    --python /opt/open-webui/venv/bin/python \
    'open-webui[all]'
