1. Record the installed version.
2. Ensure models are listed.
3. Back up Modelfiles and configuration.
4. Download the official installer script again.
5. Inspect it.
6. Run it.
7. Verify `nvidia-smi`.
8. Verify the localhost binding.
9. Test both models.

